WEBVTT

1
00:00:18,061 --> 00:00:20,411
[beruang menggeram]

2
00:00:22,326 --> 00:00:23,980
[beruang meraung]

3
00:00:25,982 --> 00:00:28,593
[angin menderu]

4
00:00:38,995 --> 00:00:42,433
[sorak sorai penonton di kejauhan]

5
00:00:50,137 --> 00:00:51,441
[Suara Christy]
Seseorang pernah bilang padaku

6
00:00:51,442 --> 00:00:52,834
aku bertarung seolah aku
sedang mencoba menghancurkan

7
00:00:52,835 --> 00:00:54,619
semua orang yang pernah
berbuat salah padaku.

8
00:00:56,012 --> 00:00:58,145
Mereka bilang aku bertarung
seperti kerasukan setan.

9
00:01:00,451 --> 00:01:01,844
Mungkin itu benar.

10
00:01:03,106 --> 00:01:04,629
Mungkin memang begitu.

11
00:01:05,456 --> 00:01:09,765
[Lagu "Head Over Heels" oleh
Tears for Fears diputar]

12
00:01:22,517 --> 00:01:24,909
[Suara Christy] Tapi pertama kali
aku melangkah ke ring tinju,

13
00:01:24,910 --> 00:01:27,086
yang kutahu hanyalah aku harus
menghajar jalang itu habis-habisan

14
00:01:27,087 --> 00:01:29,263
sebelum dia punya kesempatan
untuk memukulku.

15
00:01:34,181 --> 00:01:36,139
[penonton bersorak]

16
00:01:37,619 --> 00:01:40,578
[Lagu "Head Over Heels" berlanjut]

17
00:02:04,167 --> 00:02:05,734
[pintu terbuka]

18
00:02:06,082 --> 00:02:07,388
Hai!

19
00:02:10,347 --> 00:02:11,392
[Christy] Hei, Bu!

20
00:02:16,179 --> 00:02:18,268
Ada yang aneh.
Sikap mereka aneh.

21
00:02:18,877 --> 00:02:20,227
Lihat ini.

22
00:02:22,142 --> 00:02:23,185
Kau menang?

23
00:02:23,186 --> 00:02:24,186
- Gak mungkin.
- Hm-hm.

24
00:02:24,187 --> 00:02:26,624
- Kau kena pukul?
- Hampir enggak.

25
00:02:26,929 --> 00:02:29,191
Entahlah, mataku terpejam
setengah waktu.

26
00:02:29,192 --> 00:02:31,193
Tiga ratus dolar paling gampang
yang pernah kudapat.

27
00:02:31,194 --> 00:02:34,544
- Aku tak percaya kau melakukannya.
- Aku tahu, aku juga tidak.

28
00:02:34,545 --> 00:02:36,198
Tiga ratus dolar?

29
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:37,547
Ya Tuhan--

30
00:02:37,548 --> 00:02:39,332
Randy Salters!
Jaga bicaramu.

31
00:02:39,333 --> 00:02:41,029
Kakak menang kompetisi
Toughman.

32
00:02:41,030 --> 00:02:42,510
Coba lihat ini.

33
00:02:42,814 --> 00:02:44,773
[keduanya terkekeh]

34
00:02:45,426 --> 00:02:47,471
[langkah kaki menjauh]

35
00:02:49,821 --> 00:02:52,346
[denting alat makan]

36
00:03:07,665 --> 00:03:09,101
Ada apa sih?

37
00:03:09,798 --> 00:03:11,452
Kenapa tak ada yang bicara?

38
00:03:14,585 --> 00:03:15,412
Ayah!

39
00:03:17,501 --> 00:03:19,633
Kita bicara setelah makan siang.

40
00:03:19,634 --> 00:03:21,287
Ada masalah apa?

41
00:03:21,288 --> 00:03:22,462
[Christy] Kenapa tidak langsung--

42
00:03:22,463 --> 00:03:24,029
Pam Doolan menelepon Ayah.

43
00:03:26,945 --> 00:03:27,989
Soal apa?

44
00:03:27,990 --> 00:03:29,120
Entahlah.

45
00:03:29,121 --> 00:03:31,167
Mungkin dia
bingung atau semacamnya.

46
00:03:32,647 --> 00:03:36,999
Tapi dia mengatakan hal-hal
yang sangat, sangat buruk,

47
00:03:37,695 --> 00:03:40,045
tentang kau dan gadis itu.

48
00:03:40,698 --> 00:03:42,003
Kau tahu namanya Rosie.

49
00:03:42,004 --> 00:03:44,135
Oh, Ibu tidak tahu lagi apa
yang Ibu tahu,

50
00:03:44,136 --> 00:03:46,007
karena kau bilang dia
teman satu timmu,

51
00:03:46,008 --> 00:03:48,052
lalu dia jadi
sahabatmu,

52
00:03:48,053 --> 00:03:50,752
dan sekarang Pam mengatakan
hal ini tentang kalian berdua.

53
00:03:51,231 --> 00:03:52,970
Sekarang Pam membawanya
menemui pendeta

54
00:03:52,971 --> 00:03:54,799
untuk disembuhkan,

55
00:03:55,235 --> 00:03:57,323
dan Ayah serta Ibu berpikir
kami mungkin harus melakukan

56
00:03:57,324 --> 00:03:58,715
hal yang sama padamu.

57
00:03:58,716 --> 00:04:00,282
Aku tak mau
menemui pendeta.

58
00:04:00,283 --> 00:04:01,979
Ayah dan Ibu sudah
mendiskusikannya

59
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:04,330
dan kami tak bisa membantumu
membayar sewa lagi

60
00:04:04,331 --> 00:04:05,940
kalau kau terus
melakukan ini.

61
00:04:05,941 --> 00:04:07,116
Melakukan apa?

62
00:04:08,248 --> 00:04:10,250
[Christy] Emangnya apa yang
bisa dilakukan pendeta?

63
00:04:10,728 --> 00:04:13,208
- Apa itu benar?
- Benar apanya?

64
00:04:13,209 --> 00:04:15,820
- Apa yang orang-orang katakan.
- Apa kata mereka?

65
00:04:17,474 --> 00:04:19,563
Yah, kami tak mau kau
bertemu dia lagi.

66
00:04:20,651 --> 00:04:23,349
Orang-orang akan bilang ini salahku
dalam caraku membesarkanmu.

67
00:04:23,350 --> 00:04:26,177
Peduli amat kata mereka?
Pam Doolan itu wanita gila.

68
00:04:26,178 --> 00:04:27,614
Kenapa Ibu peduli
apa yang dia pikirkan?

69
00:04:27,615 --> 00:04:28,876
[Joyce] Jangan bicara
seperti itu padaku--

70
00:04:28,877 --> 00:04:30,051
[Christy] Kenapa tidak?

71
00:04:30,052 --> 00:04:31,182
Kalian boleh ngomong
sembarang omong kosong

72
00:04:31,183 --> 00:04:32,662
- yang muncul di kepala kalian.
- Hentikan!

73
00:04:32,663 --> 00:04:34,361
[Joyce] Hentikan!
[Johnny memukul meja]

74
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:45,067
[Joyce] Apa yang kau lakukan
itu tidak normal.

75
00:04:46,938 --> 00:04:50,507
Dan kami ingin kau punya
hidup yang bahagia dan normal.

76
00:04:51,769 --> 00:04:54,685
[suara ciuman]

77
00:04:56,513 --> 00:04:58,732
[Rosie] Aku cuma akan
bicara dengan pendeta itu.

78
00:04:58,733 --> 00:05:00,951
Aku harus melakukannya.
Kalau aku tak bicara dengannya,

79
00:05:00,952 --> 00:05:03,040
ibuku akan memotong
uang sakuku.

80
00:05:03,041 --> 00:05:05,783
- Cari kerja saja.
- Kerja apa?

81
00:05:06,436 --> 00:05:08,350
Dia akan berhenti membayar
apartemenku.

82
00:05:08,351 --> 00:05:09,351
Sepupunya punya kamar kosong.

83
00:05:09,352 --> 00:05:10,918
Dia mau aku
pindah ke sana.

84
00:05:10,919 --> 00:05:12,180
Buat apa?

85
00:05:12,181 --> 00:05:15,227
Untuk mengawasiku.
Menurutmu buat apa lagi?

86
00:05:16,925 --> 00:05:18,318
Aku tak bisa lama-lama.

87
00:05:19,754 --> 00:05:21,408
Aku harus pergi.

88
00:05:28,719 --> 00:05:31,156
[suara keributan]

89
00:05:33,071 --> 00:05:34,028
Sebelah sini!

90
00:05:34,029 --> 00:05:35,552
[gadis] Aku menjaganya!

91
00:05:41,732 --> 00:05:43,604
[tepuk tangan penonton]

92
00:05:45,127 --> 00:05:46,955
Dasar lesbian sialan.

93
00:05:50,698 --> 00:05:52,917
[keduanya mengerang dan merintih]

94
00:05:53,788 --> 00:05:55,180
[pelatih] Pisahkan sekarang!

95
00:05:55,964 --> 00:05:57,965
[pelatih] Basket itu
olahraga tim.

96
00:05:57,966 --> 00:05:59,445
Kau tak bisa ada di tim

97
00:05:59,446 --> 00:06:02,100
kalau kau terus meninju
wajah rekan setimmu.

98
00:06:02,666 --> 00:06:04,188
Ini tidak lucu.

99
00:06:04,189 --> 00:06:05,233
Dia yang mulai.

100
00:06:05,234 --> 00:06:07,409
Oh ayolah, Christy.
Dewasalah sedikit.

101
00:06:07,410 --> 00:06:08,497
Tapi dia memang mulai duluan.

102
00:06:08,498 --> 00:06:09,585
Gimana?

103
00:06:09,586 --> 00:06:11,371
Apa yang dia lakukan?

104
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:14,374
Hah?

105
00:06:15,375 --> 00:06:16,680
Apa yang dia lakukan?

106
00:06:17,681 --> 00:06:21,424
Persetan. Lupakan saja.
Sudah tidak penting.

107
00:06:27,865 --> 00:06:29,344
[anjing menggonggong]

108
00:06:29,345 --> 00:06:30,955
Baiklah, sabar dulu,
Casey.

109
00:06:31,347 --> 00:06:33,001
Aku punya makanan buatmu.

110
00:06:33,523 --> 00:06:34,568
Ini dia.

111
00:06:35,525 --> 00:06:36,960
Dasar gila.

112
00:06:36,961 --> 00:06:39,050
[telepon berdering]
Oh, sial.

113
00:06:42,184 --> 00:06:43,706
Halo, Christy bicara.

114
00:06:43,707 --> 00:06:45,752
[pria di telepon] Christy,
ini Richard Christmas.

115
00:06:45,753 --> 00:06:48,363
Saya bekerja untuk Larry Carrier.
Dia minta saya meneleponmu.

116
00:06:48,364 --> 00:06:50,800
- Maaf, Larry siapa?
- Larry Carrier.

117
00:06:50,801 --> 00:06:53,150
Dia promotor tinju di
daerah sini, Bristol, Tennessee.

118
00:06:53,151 --> 00:06:56,502
Larry melihatmu bertarung beberapa
minggu lalu di kontes Toughman.

119
00:06:56,503 --> 00:06:58,199
Dia pemilik
Bristol Speedway

120
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,548
dan sedang menyusun
pertunjukan.

121
00:06:59,549 --> 00:07:00,897
Dia ingin tahu
bagaimana perasaanmu

122
00:07:00,898 --> 00:07:02,725
untuk melakukan debut
tinju profesionalmu.

123
00:07:02,726 --> 00:07:03,813
[Christy terkekeh]

124
00:07:03,814 --> 00:07:06,990
Saya bukan... saya main basket.

125
00:07:06,991 --> 00:07:08,470
Saya bukan petinju, Pak.

126
00:07:08,471 --> 00:07:10,559
Saya belum pernah masuk
sasana tinju seumur hidup.

127
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,343
Saya ikut Toughman cuma iseng.

128
00:07:12,344 --> 00:07:14,781
Yah, Larry suka
gaya bertarungmu.

129
00:07:14,782 --> 00:07:17,000
Kami akan siapkan hotel
bagus untuk semalam,

130
00:07:17,001 --> 00:07:19,089
dan bayarannya
lima ratus dolar.

131
00:07:19,090 --> 00:07:20,962
Bagaimana menurutmu?

132
00:07:21,528 --> 00:07:24,313
[kerumunan mengobrol]

133
00:07:35,542 --> 00:07:37,848
[pria menjentikkan jari]
Ayo.

134
00:07:41,373 --> 00:07:42,810
[Rosie] Ini.

135
00:07:44,376 --> 00:07:45,813
Semoga berhasil.

136
00:07:48,729 --> 00:07:51,339
[penonton mulai riuh]

137
00:07:51,340 --> 00:07:54,343
[beberapa orang menyoraki]

138
00:07:55,823 --> 00:07:58,652
[penonton mengejek dan bersorak]

139
00:08:01,393 --> 00:08:03,178
Petarung, ke tengah ring.

140
00:08:07,095 --> 00:08:08,922
[wasit] Oke, celanamu aman di sini.

141
00:08:08,923 --> 00:08:10,314
Celanamu aman di sini.

142
00:08:10,315 --> 00:08:12,273
Saya sudah jelaskan
aturannya tadi.

143
00:08:12,274 --> 00:08:13,927
Lindungi diri setiap saat.

144
00:08:13,928 --> 00:08:16,146
Kalau saya bilang "stop" saat
bertarung, berhenti!

145
00:08:16,147 --> 00:08:17,321
Ada pertanyaan?

146
00:08:17,322 --> 00:08:18,801
Ada pertanyaan?

147
00:08:18,802 --> 00:08:20,674
Sentuh sarung tinju.
Kembali ke sudut.

148
00:08:22,023 --> 00:08:23,720
[penonton bersiul dan bersorak]

149
00:08:32,294 --> 00:08:34,209
- [bel berbunyi]
- [wasit] Mulai!

150
00:08:42,609 --> 00:08:46,395
[suara pukulan]
[mengerang dan merintih]

151
00:08:50,791 --> 00:08:52,967
[penonton bersorak]

152
00:08:53,707 --> 00:08:57,666
[wasit] Satu! Dua! Tiga!
Empat! Lima!

153
00:08:57,667 --> 00:08:59,581
[pria] Bangun!
Bangun!

154
00:08:59,582 --> 00:09:04,412
[wasit] Enam! Tujuh!
Delapan! Sembilan! Sepuluh!

155
00:09:04,413 --> 00:09:06,676
[bel berbunyi]
[penonton bersorak]

156
00:09:11,115 --> 00:09:14,249
[musik penyemangat]

157
00:09:15,598 --> 00:09:18,382
- Lihat dirimu.
- Hentikan.

158
00:09:18,383 --> 00:09:21,517
[Larry] Christy.
Larry Carrier.

159
00:09:22,605 --> 00:09:26,174
Kau hebat.
Kerja bagus.

160
00:09:28,263 --> 00:09:30,308
- Terima kasih, Pak.
- Kau pantas mendapatkannya.

161
00:09:31,788 --> 00:09:33,180
Tadi itu seru.

162
00:09:33,181 --> 00:09:34,791
Hei, izinkan saya bicara
sebentar soal sesuatu.

163
00:09:44,018 --> 00:09:46,020
Saya suka penampilanmu
di sana tadi malam.

164
00:09:46,934 --> 00:09:48,935
Saya punya pelatih yang
ingin bertemu denganmu.

165
00:09:48,936 --> 00:09:51,154
Namanya Jim Martin.
Dia pelatih hebat.

166
00:09:51,155 --> 00:09:52,982
Melatih putra saya juga,
ngomong-ngomong.

167
00:09:52,983 --> 00:09:54,114
Kenapa kau tak datang
minggu depan

168
00:09:54,115 --> 00:09:55,464
selama beberapa hari
dan menemuinya?

169
00:09:55,943 --> 00:09:58,422
Lihat-lihat sasana saya,
latihan sedikit dengannya.

170
00:09:58,423 --> 00:09:59,902
Lihat apa kau suka.

171
00:09:59,903 --> 00:10:01,904
Kalau kau suka,
saya ingin mempromosikanmu.

172
00:10:01,905 --> 00:10:03,254
Mencarikanmu lebih banyak pertarungan.

173
00:10:05,692 --> 00:10:06,953
Ya, oke, boleh.

174
00:10:06,954 --> 00:10:08,563
Mungkin kau mau ajak
ayahmu ke sana.

175
00:10:08,564 --> 00:10:11,697
Um, ayahku tidak bisa
ambil cuti kerja.

176
00:10:11,698 --> 00:10:13,569
Oke, kalau begitu, ajak
ibumu saja.

177
00:10:14,222 --> 00:10:16,266
Cukup ibumu. Jim itu...

178
00:10:16,267 --> 00:10:19,749
Dia pria yang sayang keluarga.
Kau mengerti maksudku?

179
00:10:25,929 --> 00:10:27,277
Ya, Pak.

180
00:10:27,278 --> 00:10:28,844
Dia bersemangat bertemu denganmu,
Christy.

181
00:10:28,845 --> 00:10:30,630
Mari kita lihat apa kita bisa
menjadikanmu petinju.

182
00:10:32,066 --> 00:10:35,330
[musik hip hop
diputar di latar]

183
00:11:01,051 --> 00:11:02,662
Ada yang bisa dibantu?

184
00:11:03,053 --> 00:11:04,925
Saya mencari Jim Martin.

185
00:11:05,926 --> 00:11:07,928
Itu dia, di dekat ring.

186
00:11:10,757 --> 00:11:13,455
Permisi.
Apakah Anda Jim Martin?

187
00:11:14,108 --> 00:11:15,282
Saya Christy Salters.

188
00:11:15,283 --> 00:11:17,676
Pak Carrier bilang Anda
menunggu saya.

189
00:11:17,677 --> 00:11:18,981
Saya di sini untuk berlatih.

190
00:11:18,982 --> 00:11:20,723
[Jim] Tangan di atas!

191
00:11:21,419 --> 00:11:23,334
- Pak!
- Apa?

192
00:11:23,683 --> 00:11:25,727
Saya sedang kerja.
Tony sedang coba konsentrasi.

193
00:11:25,728 --> 00:11:27,164
Kau mau apa?

194
00:11:31,647 --> 00:11:34,127
[Joyce] Hei, mau ke mana, hmm?

195
00:11:34,128 --> 00:11:36,433
- [Larry] Christy! Kau datang!
- Dia tak mau melatihku.

196
00:11:36,434 --> 00:11:38,218
- Dia brengsek.
- Christy!

197
00:11:38,219 --> 00:11:40,611
- Jim!
Hei Jim!
- Yap?

198
00:11:40,612 --> 00:11:42,310
[Larry] Turun ke sini.

199
00:11:42,789 --> 00:11:43,964
Lanjutkan, kawan.

200
00:11:45,922 --> 00:11:47,618
Jim, ini, ah,
Christy Salters.

201
00:11:47,619 --> 00:11:49,446
Sudah kubilang dia akan
datang hari ini.

202
00:11:49,447 --> 00:11:52,450
Oh, ya.
Hai, Christy.
Senang bertemu denganmu.

203
00:11:55,192 --> 00:11:56,671
Hei, Jim Martin.

204
00:11:56,672 --> 00:11:59,806
- Saya Joyce. Ibunya Christy.
- Senang bertemu.

205
00:12:02,417 --> 00:12:05,071
Larry sudah bayar
hotelnya.

206
00:12:05,072 --> 00:12:07,161
Kau bilang kau akan
mencobanya.

207
00:12:07,683 --> 00:12:10,859
Aku bilang aku akan datang dan
melihatnya. Aku sudah lihat.

208
00:12:10,860 --> 00:12:13,122
Orang itu brengsek.
Aku mau pulang.

209
00:12:13,123 --> 00:12:17,387
Aku cuma berpikir kalau Larry menawarimu
tempat tinggal, gratis sewa,

210
00:12:17,388 --> 00:12:20,086
dan pekerjaan, serta pelatih,

211
00:12:20,087 --> 00:12:21,566
itu kesempatan nyata.

212
00:12:22,002 --> 00:12:23,611
Dan sekarang kau malah
tidak bersyukur.

213
00:12:23,612 --> 00:12:27,964
Dia tak mau melatihku.
Ibu lihat sendiri. Itu memalukan.

214
00:12:29,444 --> 00:12:32,576
Baiklah.
Kita pulang.

215
00:12:32,577 --> 00:12:34,404
Aku jauh-jauh datang ke sini bukan

216
00:12:34,405 --> 00:12:37,016
cuma buat lihat kamu nyerah
segampang itu.

217
00:12:37,017 --> 00:12:39,627
Dan cuma karena ada orang
ngomong kasar padamu,

218
00:12:39,628 --> 00:12:41,499
yah, begitulah cara kerjanya latihan.

219
00:12:41,978 --> 00:12:45,808
Emang keras. Tujuannya biar
kamu jadi tangguh.

220
00:12:49,029 --> 00:12:50,334
Hmm...

221
00:12:51,379 --> 00:12:54,121
Padahal kupikir kamu udah tangguh.

222
00:12:57,167 --> 00:12:58,907
Aku mau lihat
gerakanmu.

223
00:12:58,908 --> 00:13:01,910
Gunakan jab-mu. Tunjukkan
kombinasi pukulanmu.

224
00:13:01,911 --> 00:13:02,998
Nggak usah terlalu gaya.

225
00:13:02,999 --> 00:13:04,653
Walt, pelan-pelan sama dia.

226
00:13:06,481 --> 00:13:08,309
Coba kita lihat kemampuanmu.

227
00:13:09,223 --> 00:13:10,964
[berbisik]
Habisi dia.

228
00:13:14,881 --> 00:13:17,622
Hajar dia. Patahkan rusuknya
kalau perlu.

229
00:13:21,626 --> 00:13:24,804
[musik tegang memuncak]

230
00:13:37,164 --> 00:13:38,861
[Christy berteriak keras]

231
00:13:39,209 --> 00:13:40,907
[Christy mengerang]

232
00:13:43,213 --> 00:13:45,694
[merintih dan napas berat]

233
00:13:53,354 --> 00:13:54,702
[suara gedebuk keras]

234
00:13:54,703 --> 00:13:55,791
[Christy] Maaf.

235
00:13:56,270 --> 00:13:57,661
Maaf, aku nggak sengaja.

236
00:13:57,662 --> 00:14:00,578
- [Jim] Astaga, Tuhan.
- Maaf.

237
00:14:01,666 --> 00:14:03,190
Hah.

238
00:14:04,321 --> 00:14:06,802
[kendaraan menderu kencang]

239
00:14:25,168 --> 00:14:28,476
[kendaraan menderu kencang]

240
00:14:38,138 --> 00:14:39,312
[pintu terbuka]

241
00:14:39,313 --> 00:14:40,880
[pria] Oke, Christy,
ini tempatmu.

242
00:14:42,142 --> 00:14:44,492
Listrik air semua sudah dibayar.

243
00:14:45,058 --> 00:14:46,797
Telepon tersambung
ke kantor,

244
00:14:46,798 --> 00:14:48,277
jadi kalau ada telepon
masuk buatmu,

245
00:14:48,278 --> 00:14:49,539
mereka bakal sambungkan ke sini.

246
00:14:49,540 --> 00:14:53,240
Kalau di luar jam kerja,
telepon langsung masuk ke kamu.

247
00:14:53,718 --> 00:14:54,805
Kalau ada yang nelpon kantor,

248
00:14:54,806 --> 00:14:57,330
tinggal catat pesannya
buat Polly.

249
00:14:57,331 --> 00:15:00,289
Atau, kamu bisa minta Polly
alihkan ke mesin penjawab,

250
00:15:00,290 --> 00:15:02,639
tapi itu artinya nggak ada yang
bisa nelpon kamu pas malam.

251
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:04,076
Kayaknya kamu nggak
mau begitu, kan.

252
00:15:04,077 --> 00:15:05,730
Atur saja nanti sama Polly.

253
00:15:06,209 --> 00:15:08,297
Kalau ada apa-apa,
telepon aku.

254
00:15:08,298 --> 00:15:09,908
Kamu cuma punya 12 hari
sebelum tanding,

255
00:15:09,909 --> 00:15:11,345
jadi manfaatkan baik-baik.

256
00:15:12,215 --> 00:15:13,302
Beres.

257
00:15:13,303 --> 00:15:14,783
Sip.

258
00:15:18,961 --> 00:15:20,528
[pintu tertutup]

259
00:15:21,224 --> 00:15:22,617
Sini kamu.
[terkekeh]

260
00:15:25,925 --> 00:15:30,799
[musik tegang memuncak]

261
00:15:37,675 --> 00:15:41,027
Dorong kaki belakang,
maju, hentakkan pukulan.

262
00:16:03,179 --> 00:16:04,180
[Jim] Siku masuk!

263
00:16:05,051 --> 00:16:06,660
Tanganmu lagi ngapain?
Angkat tanganmu

264
00:16:06,661 --> 00:16:09,011
atau kamu bakal
dipukul sampai terjengkang.

265
00:16:11,448 --> 00:16:14,234
[musik semangat memuncak]

266
00:16:17,628 --> 00:16:21,544
[Christy berteriak]

267
00:16:21,545 --> 00:16:24,287
[anjing menggonggong]

268
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,775
[bel pintu berbunyi]

269
00:16:51,314 --> 00:16:52,750
Makan apa?

270
00:16:53,403 --> 00:16:54,448
Burger.

271
00:16:54,796 --> 00:16:57,233
Ya, aku ke sini cari steak.
Steak-nya enak.

272
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:05,067
Mau duduk?

273
00:17:09,115 --> 00:17:10,246
Boleh.

274
00:17:14,033 --> 00:17:15,685
- [pelayan] Eh, halo Jim.
- [Jim] Hei.

275
00:17:15,686 --> 00:17:16,860
Biasa?

276
00:17:16,861 --> 00:17:18,601
- Makasih, ya.
- Oke.

277
00:17:18,602 --> 00:17:20,386
Mau pesan pai lagi, neng?

278
00:17:20,387 --> 00:17:23,042
- Iya, mau bu.
- Dia kopi saja.

279
00:17:24,608 --> 00:17:25,653
Aku nggak mau kopi.

280
00:17:26,045 --> 00:17:28,047
Yah, aku nggak mau
melatih petinju gendut.

281
00:17:31,528 --> 00:17:32,529
Minta bonnya saja, bu.

282
00:17:40,929 --> 00:17:43,671
Kamu latihan lebih keras
daripada kebanyakan pria yang kulatih.

283
00:17:44,715 --> 00:17:46,587
Aku latihan mati-matian.

284
00:17:48,415 --> 00:17:50,285
Larry itu orang pintar.

285
00:17:50,286 --> 00:17:51,895
Dia pikir ada peluang

286
00:17:51,896 --> 00:17:55,421
di bisnis tinju wanita ini,
entahlah.

287
00:17:55,422 --> 00:17:56,771
Kita lihat saja.

288
00:17:57,293 --> 00:17:58,773
Mungkin dia benar.

289
00:17:59,426 --> 00:18:03,038
Mungkin aku akan menjadikanmu
petinju wanita terbaik di dunia.

290
00:18:07,086 --> 00:18:09,479
[mobil bergemerutuk]

291
00:18:39,205 --> 00:18:41,685
[musik lembut]

292
00:19:00,965 --> 00:19:02,750
[Jim] Gimana perasaanmu?

293
00:19:04,230 --> 00:19:05,796
Baik, kayaknya.

294
00:19:07,929 --> 00:19:10,932
Pokoknya jab, jab, jab.
Puter dia kayak gasing.

295
00:19:11,933 --> 00:19:14,457
Aku mau lihat mereka
membalut tangan Whitcomb.

296
00:19:18,244 --> 00:19:19,636
Kamu kelihatan manis.

297
00:19:32,823 --> 00:19:36,653
[musik lembut memuncak]

298
00:19:45,445 --> 00:19:49,275
[musik termenung]

299
00:20:11,819 --> 00:20:14,213
[penonton bersorak]

300
00:20:16,171 --> 00:20:18,695
[mendengus dan mengerang]

301
00:20:27,835 --> 00:20:29,183
[Jim] Bagus mainmu di sana.

302
00:20:29,184 --> 00:20:30,576
Terus layangkan
jab-jab itu, ya?

303
00:20:30,577 --> 00:20:32,231
Gerakkan kepalamu.
Jab, jab, jab.

304
00:20:39,716 --> 00:20:41,151
[wasit] Mundur.

305
00:20:41,152 --> 00:20:42,979
[penonton bersorak]

306
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:44,765
[Walt] Ya!

307
00:20:46,462 --> 00:20:50,030
Lima! Enam!

308
00:20:50,031 --> 00:20:53,338
Tujuh! Delapan!

309
00:20:53,339 --> 00:20:56,559
Sembilan! Sepuluh!

310
00:20:56,907 --> 00:21:00,433
Ya! Ya!

311
00:21:07,788 --> 00:21:11,181
[Jim] Kerja bagus!
Ya! Oke!

312
00:21:11,182 --> 00:21:12,705
[Christy] Gila,
percaya nggak sih?

313
00:21:12,706 --> 00:21:14,184
Rasanya luar biasa banget.

314
00:21:14,185 --> 00:21:15,751
Aku bingung
gimana jelasinnya,

315
00:21:15,752 --> 00:21:16,839
tapi rasanya beneran ajaib.

316
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:18,319
Cewek lawanku tadi,
dia tangguh,

317
00:21:18,320 --> 00:21:20,452
tapi dia lambat jadi aku bisa
hindari semua pukulannya

318
00:21:20,453 --> 00:21:22,192
dan semua jab-ku masuk.

319
00:21:22,193 --> 00:21:25,849
Rasanya kayak...
Aku menemukan duniaku.

320
00:21:26,241 --> 00:21:27,633
Pasti banyak orang yang
seumur hidupnya

321
00:21:27,634 --> 00:21:29,418
nggak pernah tahu
apa panggilan hidup mereka.

322
00:21:30,158 --> 00:21:31,724
[Rosie di telepon]
Nih, pegang ini.

323
00:21:31,725 --> 00:21:33,640
[pria] Oke. Ayo pergi.

324
00:21:34,554 --> 00:21:36,251
Rosie, masih di situ?

325
00:21:37,252 --> 00:21:39,210
[Rosie] Jadi, tinju itu
dunia kamu?

326
00:21:40,429 --> 00:21:43,518
Ya, mungkin.
Entahlah.

327
00:21:43,519 --> 00:21:45,478
Aku jago banget soalnya.

328
00:21:47,393 --> 00:21:49,873
[Rosie] Tapi itu bukan karir, kan?

329
00:21:53,050 --> 00:21:55,095
Aku ada pertandingan lagi
enam minggu lagi.

330
00:21:55,096 --> 00:21:57,271
Mungkin kamu mau
datang nonton.

331
00:21:57,272 --> 00:22:00,319
[Rosie] Ya, mungkin.
Nggak tahulah.

332
00:22:07,108 --> 00:22:11,024
Larry juga kasih aku kerjaan
di toko sebelah gym.

333
00:22:11,025 --> 00:22:12,591
Buat uang tambahan--

334
00:22:12,592 --> 00:22:15,245
[Rosie] Christy, aku maunya
ngomong langsung, sungguh.

335
00:22:15,246 --> 00:22:20,295
Tapi aku juga harus
bilang ini sekarang.

336
00:22:21,296 --> 00:22:24,559
Kupikir hubungan jarak jauh
ini bakal berhasil,

337
00:22:24,560 --> 00:22:27,955
tapi... aku ketemu seseorang.

338
00:22:29,086 --> 00:22:30,697
Aku ketemu cowok.

339
00:22:31,524 --> 00:22:34,135
Kamu pasti suka dia,
kurasa. Entahlah.

340
00:22:36,093 --> 00:22:38,182
Aku merasa bersalah
soal ini--

341
00:22:40,489 --> 00:22:45,015
[musik elektronik mendesak]

342
00:22:51,326 --> 00:22:53,633
[penonton bersorak]

343
00:22:57,985 --> 00:23:01,771
[wasit] Satu! Dua! Tiga!

344
00:23:02,511 --> 00:23:07,647
Empat! Lima! Enam! Tujuh!

345
00:23:08,082 --> 00:23:11,258
Delapan! Sembilan! Sepuluh!

346
00:23:11,259 --> 00:23:14,305
Ya! Ya!

347
00:23:16,133 --> 00:23:17,526
Itu Christy!

348
00:23:40,636 --> 00:23:42,638
[penonton bersorak]

349
00:23:45,772 --> 00:23:47,163
[Christy] Ya!

350
00:23:47,164 --> 00:23:48,557
Ya!

351
00:23:49,253 --> 00:23:51,386
- Oh!
- Ya!

352
00:23:51,865 --> 00:23:53,606
[berciuman]

353
00:23:53,910 --> 00:23:55,651
[Christy] Ya!

354
00:23:58,088 --> 00:23:59,960
Whoo!

355
00:24:05,356 --> 00:24:07,010
[Jim] Oh!
[tertawa]

356
00:24:09,186 --> 00:24:11,493
[Christy] Ya ampun.
- Tuh dia. Di sebelah sana.

357
00:24:18,631 --> 00:24:19,936
[Jim] Kamu mainnya pakai emosi.

358
00:24:21,155 --> 00:24:23,548
Itu juga kata pelatih
basketku dulu.

359
00:24:23,549 --> 00:24:26,986
Aku terlalu agresif.
Makanya aku suka tinju.

360
00:24:26,987 --> 00:24:31,033
Yah, tinju itu cuma
lima persen agresi.

361
00:24:31,034 --> 00:24:34,473
Sisanya strategi dan kontrol.

362
00:24:35,691 --> 00:24:37,126
[bola biliar beradu]

363
00:24:37,127 --> 00:24:38,999
Ini catur.

364
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:41,567
Kamu nggak bisa main catur
kalau marah, kan?

365
00:24:42,742 --> 00:24:44,221
Kamu harus atur langkah.

366
00:24:47,224 --> 00:24:50,139
Maksudku, kamu menghindar,
kamu mengecoh.

367
00:24:50,140 --> 00:24:51,314
Lawan pikir aku mau
ke sini,

368
00:24:51,315 --> 00:24:53,404
padahal aslinya aku
mau ke sana.

369
00:24:55,319 --> 00:24:57,104
Kamu memainkan
sebuah karakter.

370
00:24:58,105 --> 00:25:01,935
Kamu adalah karakter
merah muda yang manis.

371
00:25:07,506 --> 00:25:09,202
Kamu harusnya panjangkan
rambutmu.

372
00:25:09,203 --> 00:25:10,900
Bakal lebih bagus kalau panjang.

373
00:25:14,774 --> 00:25:16,644
Nanti kena muka.

374
00:25:16,645 --> 00:25:18,778
Kamu bakal lebih cantik
kalau rambut panjang.

375
00:25:19,822 --> 00:25:21,606
Kalau begitu kelihatan kayak cowok.

376
00:25:21,607 --> 00:25:23,739
Nggak ada yang mau lihat
cewek maskulin berantem.

377
00:25:24,261 --> 00:25:26,046
Kamu tahu itu.

378
00:25:27,526 --> 00:25:28,962
Iya kan?

379
00:25:30,790 --> 00:25:32,400
Aku ngobrol sama Joyce.

380
00:25:33,227 --> 00:25:36,098
Dia bilang kamu harus
pergi dari West Virginia.

381
00:25:36,099 --> 00:25:38,624
Dia cerita soal Rosie.

382
00:25:40,364 --> 00:25:42,148
Kapan kamu ngobrol
sama ibuku?

383
00:25:42,149 --> 00:25:44,368
Kenapa kamu nggak
punya pacar?

384
00:25:45,674 --> 00:25:47,807
Kamu pikir nggak bisa dapat cowok?

385
00:25:49,635 --> 00:25:51,113
Aku cuma...

386
00:25:51,114 --> 00:25:53,464
Aku cuma mau fokuskan
semua energiku ke tinju.

387
00:25:54,335 --> 00:25:55,510
Yah.

388
00:25:56,293 --> 00:25:57,599
Kulihat itu.

389
00:26:00,559 --> 00:26:04,518
Aku mungkin kadang
ngocehin kamu,

390
00:26:04,519 --> 00:26:06,433
itu karena aku mau
kamu latihan keras.

391
00:26:06,434 --> 00:26:09,959
Aku mau kamu latihan keras
karena kamu punya sesuatu.

392
00:26:12,701 --> 00:26:14,920
Aku nggak yakin apa
"sesuatu" itu,

393
00:26:14,921 --> 00:26:16,662
tapi jelas ada.

394
00:26:18,577 --> 00:26:20,100
Aku percaya itu.

395
00:26:26,802 --> 00:26:28,021
Giliranmu.

396
00:26:30,197 --> 00:26:33,069
[musik lembut]

397
00:26:53,002 --> 00:26:56,310
[kendaraan menderu kencang]

398
00:27:01,576 --> 00:27:04,927
[musik lembut berlanjut]

399
00:27:07,713 --> 00:27:10,280
[telepon berdering]

400
00:27:16,199 --> 00:27:17,678
Halo.

401
00:27:17,679 --> 00:27:19,680
[Jim di telepon] Hei,
ini Jim.

402
00:27:19,681 --> 00:27:21,117
Lagi ngapain?

403
00:27:22,945 --> 00:27:24,120
Hm...

404
00:27:25,861 --> 00:27:27,384
Nggak ngapa-ngapain.

405
00:27:30,257 --> 00:27:33,477
- Cuma duduk.
- Mau mampir?

406
00:27:41,572 --> 00:27:42,965
Hei.

407
00:27:45,228 --> 00:27:47,100
Kita harus
ke gym.

408
00:27:59,460 --> 00:28:02,637
[air shower mengalir]

409
00:28:07,468 --> 00:28:11,037
[telepon memutar nomor]

410
00:28:13,343 --> 00:28:15,518
[di telepon]
Johnny Salters bicara.

411
00:28:15,519 --> 00:28:16,911
[Christy] Halo, Yah.

412
00:28:16,912 --> 00:28:19,827
[Johnny] Halo, sayang.
Apa kabar?

413
00:28:19,828 --> 00:28:21,656
Aku baik.

414
00:28:23,005 --> 00:28:24,833
[Johnny] Kamu nggak apa-apa, Nak?

415
00:28:28,141 --> 00:28:29,969
Ya, aku baik-baik saja.

416
00:28:32,232 --> 00:28:34,060
Aku cuma kangen Ayah.

417
00:28:34,887 --> 00:28:36,932
Kayaknya aku mau
pulang.

418
00:28:40,631 --> 00:28:42,372
[ketukan di pintu]

419
00:28:48,117 --> 00:28:49,902
Sini.

420
00:29:33,249 --> 00:29:34,860
Hei.

421
00:29:36,731 --> 00:29:38,341
[Christy] Aku bilang mau coba
selama enam bulan.

422
00:29:39,212 --> 00:29:40,256
Sudah kulakukan.

423
00:29:40,822 --> 00:29:42,040
Aku harus mulai mikirin

424
00:29:42,041 --> 00:29:43,432
apa yang sebenarnya mau
kulakukan dengan hidupku.

425
00:29:43,433 --> 00:29:44,825
Tinju.

426
00:29:44,826 --> 00:29:46,479
Tinju itu jalan hidupmu.

427
00:29:46,480 --> 00:29:48,786
- Kamu sedang menjalaninya.
- Aku nggak bisa cari makan dari situ.

428
00:29:48,787 --> 00:29:51,180
Larry nggak bisa cari wanita
buat lawan tandingku.

429
00:29:55,663 --> 00:29:57,708
Aku sudah melatih banyak pria,

430
00:29:58,666 --> 00:30:00,059
dan...

431
00:30:01,887 --> 00:30:04,018
Nggak pernah ada satu pun
yang menurutku

432
00:30:04,019 --> 00:30:06,892
punya bakat untuk
berhasil sampai puncak.

433
00:30:08,241 --> 00:30:11,461
Beruntung kalau bisa dapat satu
yang begitu seumur hidup.

434
00:30:12,506 --> 00:30:14,551
Itu yang kulihat padamu.

435
00:30:15,857 --> 00:30:17,858
Aku serius waktu bilang

436
00:30:17,859 --> 00:30:22,081
aku bisa menjadikanmu petinju
wanita terhebat di dunia.

437
00:30:23,473 --> 00:30:25,040
Dibanding siapa?

438
00:30:25,911 --> 00:30:27,608
Nggak ada yang melakukannya.

439
00:30:28,043 --> 00:30:30,044
Nggak ada yang dibayar
untuk itu.

440
00:30:30,045 --> 00:30:31,699
[Jim] Itu bakal berubah.

441
00:30:32,787 --> 00:30:36,008
Lenny Del Percio di Florida
mau jadi promotormu.

442
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:39,837
Dia punya apartemen
buat kita di Daytona,

443
00:30:39,838 --> 00:30:41,751
dan dia bisa carikan pertandingan.

444
00:30:41,752 --> 00:30:47,062
Dan saat waktunya tepat,
aku bakal telepon Don King.

445
00:30:51,110 --> 00:30:52,893
Don baru pindah balik ke Miami,

446
00:30:52,894 --> 00:30:55,983
dan kalau kamu siap
aku akan meneleponnya.

447
00:30:55,984 --> 00:30:59,161
Tapi kamu harus usaha.

448
00:30:59,945 --> 00:31:01,642
Kamu harus benar-benar mau.

449
00:31:03,035 --> 00:31:05,601
Nah, kalau kamu mau tetap
di West Virginia...

450
00:31:05,602 --> 00:31:07,474
[tertawa]

451
00:31:07,866 --> 00:31:09,824
Aku nggak bisa melarang.

452
00:31:10,956 --> 00:31:13,088
Tapi, rasanya kamu nggak mau.

453
00:31:14,002 --> 00:31:15,917
Kulihat itu di
matamu.

454
00:31:16,526 --> 00:31:18,963
Aku sudah siapkan tempat enak

455
00:31:18,964 --> 00:31:22,532
yang menunggu kita
di Daytona.

456
00:31:25,144 --> 00:31:26,797
Daytona Beach?

457
00:31:27,320 --> 00:31:29,191
Daytona Beach.

458
00:31:33,543 --> 00:31:36,197
Daytona Beach, sayang!

459
00:31:36,198 --> 00:31:38,679
[lonceng angin berdenting]

460
00:31:40,159 --> 00:31:41,724
[semua tertawa]

461
00:31:41,725 --> 00:31:43,335
Aaron Pryor itu temanku.

