1585
01:53:29,541 --> 01:53:31,021
Ada yang bisa saya
hubungi?

1586
01:53:31,805 --> 01:53:33,283
- Rosie.
- Rosie?

1587
01:53:33,284 --> 01:53:35,329
Oke, kamu hafal
nomor Rosie?

1588
01:53:35,330 --> 01:53:39,202
[Christy] 681 - 735 - 0102.

1589
01:53:39,203 --> 01:53:42,031
[perawat] 681 735 0102?

1590
01:53:42,032 --> 01:53:43,598
- Ya.
- Oke.

1591
01:53:43,599 --> 01:53:45,382
Saya bakal telepon dia dan kasih
tahu keadaannya, oke?

1592
01:53:45,383 --> 01:53:46,557
Kamu bakal sembuh.

1593
01:53:46,558 --> 01:53:48,169
Kami bakal merawatmu, oke?

1594
01:53:48,778 --> 01:53:50,170
[dokter pria] Siapkan dia
untuk dipindahkan

1595
01:53:50,171 --> 01:53:51,737
dan hentikan pendarahan ini.

1596
01:53:52,738 --> 01:53:54,392
Tolong telepon Rosie.

1597
01:54:09,930 --> 01:54:11,627
Dia selamat.

1598
01:54:12,758 --> 01:54:15,196
[bunyi mesin medis]

1599
01:54:16,153 --> 01:54:17,632
Sayang.

1600
01:54:17,633 --> 01:54:20,549
Kondisinya parah, tapi kata
dokter dia bakal selamat.

1601
01:54:21,680 --> 01:54:23,378
[Johnny] Oh, sayangku.

1602
01:54:24,205 --> 01:54:25,422
Dia sempat sadar?

1603
01:54:25,423 --> 01:54:27,903
[Rosie] Dia sadar pas aku,
pas aku sampai sini.

1604
01:54:27,904 --> 01:54:29,514
Dia sadar terus pingsan lagi.

1605
01:54:32,300 --> 01:54:34,215
Oh, aku minta maaf.

1606
01:54:35,956 --> 01:54:37,566
Maafkan aku.

1607
01:54:41,831 --> 01:54:43,964
Bisa kita bicara di luar sebentar?

1608
01:54:55,627 --> 01:54:57,673
Kamu harus pergi.

1609
01:54:58,413 --> 01:55:00,763
Nggak pantas kamu ada di sini.

1610
01:55:01,242 --> 01:55:02,416
Christy mau aku di sini.

1611
01:55:02,417 --> 01:55:04,723
Christy nggak tahu
apa yang dia mau.

1612
01:55:06,769 --> 01:55:09,076
Gara-gara kamu ini semua terjadi.

1613
01:55:10,381 --> 01:55:13,732
Aku ibunya,
dan aku minta kamu pergi.

1614
01:55:14,777 --> 01:55:17,562
Dan aku nggak mau bahas ini lagi.

1615
01:55:28,878 --> 01:55:30,358
Mana Rosie?

1616
01:55:31,881 --> 01:55:33,317
Dia pergi.

1617
01:55:34,449 --> 01:55:35,972
Pergi ke mana?

1618
01:55:37,843 --> 01:55:39,323
Nggak tahu.

1619
01:55:41,935 --> 01:55:44,545
- Mana Jim?
- Dia sudah ditangkap.

1620
01:55:44,546 --> 01:55:46,243
Polisi menemukannya.

1621
01:55:46,983 --> 01:55:49,419
Sembunyi di gudang alat
tetanggamu.

1622
01:55:49,420 --> 01:55:51,378
Untung polisi nemuin dia
duluan sebelum aku.

1623
01:55:51,379 --> 01:55:53,076
Sudah kubunuh bajingan itu.

1624
01:55:54,338 --> 01:55:56,514
Begini,
berita ini ada di mana-mana.

1625
01:55:58,125 --> 01:56:00,431
Dan semua orang bilang,

1626
01:56:01,432 --> 01:56:05,567
kalau kamu mau ninggalin Jim
demi wanita itu.

1627
01:56:07,221 --> 01:56:08,569
Nama wanita itu Rosie.

1628
01:56:08,570 --> 01:56:10,572
Ibu tahu.

1629
01:56:11,790 --> 01:56:15,358
Jadi Ibu pikir,
kamu bisa bilang,

1630
01:56:15,359 --> 01:56:18,232
kalau kamu lagi sama
Rosie yang satu lagi.

1631
01:56:19,581 --> 01:56:22,017
Tahu kan, Rosie Graham.

1632
01:56:22,018 --> 01:56:24,106
Dengan begitu orang-orang
bakal paham

1633
01:56:24,107 --> 01:56:25,542
kalau dia cuma teman--

1634
01:56:25,543 --> 01:56:28,284
[Randy] Bu.
Ibu ngapain sih?

1635
01:56:28,285 --> 01:56:30,374
Yang benar saja, Bu?

1636
01:56:33,116 --> 01:56:35,814
Sama saja kayak Ibu yang
nembak dia sendiri.

1637
01:56:41,037 --> 01:56:42,560
[menghela napas]

1638
01:56:44,040 --> 01:56:45,562
[Christy]
Aku berharap bisa jadi

1639
01:56:45,563 --> 01:56:47,478
anak perempuan yang Ibu mau.

1640
01:56:48,914 --> 01:56:51,134
Seumur hidup aku mencoba.

1641
01:56:51,787 --> 01:56:54,355
Aku berusaha keras banget
demi Ibu.

1642
01:57:00,230 --> 01:57:02,406
Dan lihat aku sekarang, Bu.

1643
01:57:04,408 --> 01:57:06,106
Lihat keadaanku.

1644
01:57:09,979 --> 01:57:14,592
[musik sedih]

1645
01:58:01,161 --> 01:58:03,511
[perawat] Dokter minta
kamu jalan, Christy.

1646
01:58:04,599 --> 01:58:06,296
Ini alat bantumu.

1647
01:58:07,776 --> 01:58:09,516
Aku nggak butuh itu.

1648
01:58:09,517 --> 01:58:11,300
Kamu nggak boleh ke mana-mana
tanpa alat bantu ini.

1649
01:58:11,301 --> 01:58:13,303
Perintah dokter.

1650
01:58:28,492 --> 01:58:30,015
Lisa Holewyne, gila lo?

1651
01:58:32,627 --> 01:58:34,672
Ngapain kamu di sini?

1652
01:58:36,152 --> 01:58:38,198
[Lisa] Moga-moga nggak apa-apa
aku tiba-tiba muncul.

1653
01:58:39,068 --> 01:58:42,027
Aku cuma mau memastikan
kamu baik-baik saja.

1654
01:58:43,159 --> 01:58:44,378
Makasih.

1655
01:58:50,035 --> 01:58:51,689
Jadi siapa itu Rosie?

1656
01:58:54,214 --> 01:58:56,302
[terkekeh]

1657
01:58:56,303 --> 01:58:58,782
Kamu jelas nggak keluar dari
"lemari" pelan-pelan.

1658
01:58:58,783 --> 01:59:00,480
[tertawa] Ya...

1659
01:59:00,481 --> 01:59:02,177
Kamu langsung mendobraknya.

1660
01:59:02,178 --> 01:59:03,484
[Christy tertawa]

1661
01:59:05,138 --> 01:59:06,574
Wah...

1662
01:59:07,401 --> 01:59:09,490
Orang-orang bakal
menghujatku.

1663
01:59:10,795 --> 01:59:13,581
Separuh karirku kuhabiskan buat
mengina wanita lawanku.

1664
01:59:14,408 --> 01:59:15,973
Ngatain mereka lesbi
atau apalah.

1665
01:59:15,974 --> 01:59:17,714
- Oh, ya?
- Mm-hm.

1666
01:59:17,715 --> 01:59:19,587
Wow.

1667
01:59:20,283 --> 01:59:21,980
Orang-orang bakal
ngetawain aku.

1668
01:59:23,286 --> 01:59:26,681
Mungkin saja.
Kamu pantas menerimanya.

1669
01:59:27,334 --> 01:59:28,596
[pelan] Yah.

1670
01:59:29,988 --> 01:59:31,338
Tapi mungkin juga nggak.

1671
01:59:34,123 --> 01:59:38,562
Mungkin kamu cuma terbiasa
berharap yang terburuk dari orang lain.

1672
01:59:46,309 --> 01:59:47,876
Aku mau tanding lagi.

1673
01:59:49,269 --> 01:59:50,357
Serius?

1674
01:59:51,662 --> 01:59:52,794
Ya.

1675
01:59:54,143 --> 01:59:56,450
Kamu tahu nggak ada yang bakal
nyalahin kamu kalau kamu berhenti.

1676
01:59:56,928 --> 01:59:58,146
Iya kan?

1677
01:59:58,147 --> 02:00:00,454
Kamu sudah mengalahkan
semua lawan yang ada.

1678
02:00:02,717 --> 02:00:04,371
Aku mau itu kembali.

1679
02:00:05,459 --> 02:00:07,200
Aku mau ring itu kembali.

1680
02:00:09,680 --> 02:00:12,161
Di sana, aku tenang.

1681
02:00:13,380 --> 02:00:16,687
Di sana, hening. Segalanya
jadi hening, tahu nggak?

1682
02:00:18,298 --> 02:00:19,473
Ya.

1683
02:00:20,996 --> 02:00:22,432
Ya, aku tahu.

1684
02:00:22,867 --> 02:00:25,043
Ada aturan dan
ada batasannya.

1685
02:00:26,001 --> 02:00:31,093
Di tempat lain kacau balau,
tapi di sana hening.

1686
02:00:32,137 --> 02:00:33,487
Dan itu punyaku.

1687
02:00:35,053 --> 02:00:36,577
Dan aku mau itu tanpa dia.

1688
02:00:48,545 --> 02:00:49,938
Yah...

1689
02:00:52,636 --> 02:00:54,116
Semoga berhasil.

1690
02:00:59,556 --> 02:01:01,079
Makasih.

1691
02:01:12,917 --> 02:01:17,487
Oke, ayo bangun.

1692
02:01:19,794 --> 02:01:21,055
Singkirkan benda itu.

1693
02:01:21,056 --> 02:01:23,579
- Ayo, nenek.
- Aku nggak mau.

1694
02:01:23,580 --> 02:01:24,711
Biar siap tinju.

1695
02:01:24,712 --> 02:01:26,669
- Ayo, nek.
- Aku nggak mau pakai itu.

1696
02:01:26,670 --> 02:01:28,149
- Nggak mau pakai ini?
- Ogah.

1697
02:01:28,150 --> 02:01:29,977
- Harusnya wajib pakai.
- Nggak tuh.

1698
02:01:29,978 --> 02:01:32,415
[Lisa] Nggak? Sini aku ambil.

1699
02:01:33,155 --> 02:01:34,330
Ayo.

1700
02:01:35,984 --> 02:01:37,681
Enak nih.
Bagus buat latihan dips.

1701
02:01:38,116 --> 02:01:39,901
Biar olahraga dikit.

1702
02:01:42,120 --> 02:01:43,600
Ayo kejar.

1703
02:01:46,386 --> 02:01:50,259
[musik lembut emosional]

1704
02:01:59,790 --> 02:02:02,750
[suara tinju]

1705
02:02:08,756 --> 02:02:13,369
[musik emosional berlanjut]

1706
02:02:25,076 --> 02:02:26,948
Psst! Woy.

1707
02:02:30,604 --> 02:02:32,257
Hei kawan-kawan, tunggu.

1708
02:02:49,492 --> 02:02:51,276
Aku minta maaf.

1709
02:03:03,680 --> 02:03:07,031
[musik lembut emosional memuncak]

1710
02:03:13,168 --> 02:03:14,864
[Miguel] Entahlah, Christy.

1711
02:03:14,865 --> 02:03:18,302
Kuingatkan saja, kamu baru ditembak
dan ditusuk dua minggu lalu.

1712
02:03:18,303 --> 02:03:19,913
Iya, terus?

1713
02:03:19,914 --> 02:03:22,611
[Miguel] Ya, jadi aku nggak yakin
kamu boleh latihan sekarang.

1714
02:03:22,612 --> 02:03:24,221
Kamu harus sembuh dulu.

1715
02:03:24,222 --> 02:03:27,877
Ini caraku sembuh.
Aku mau tanding.

1716
02:03:27,878 --> 02:03:30,315
Aku mau kamu melatihku.
Bisa carikan aku lawan?

1717
02:03:31,142 --> 02:03:34,189
[Christy] Ayolah, Papi.
Carikan aku lawan.

1718
02:03:37,061 --> 02:03:38,019
Jeff?

1719
02:03:45,287 --> 02:03:46,679
Oke, juara.

1720
02:03:46,680 --> 02:03:48,725
Beres.
Kita carikan kamu lawan.

1721
02:03:49,422 --> 02:03:50,901
[Shortdog] Mantap, anjing!

1722
02:03:59,954 --> 02:04:01,738
[mengerang pelan]

1723
02:04:02,173 --> 02:04:04,218
[Suara Hati Christy]
Aku pergi ke restoran

1724
02:04:04,219 --> 02:04:06,526
dan aku sadar aku nggak tahu
mau pesan apa.

1725
02:04:08,049 --> 02:04:10,486
Aku nggak tahu mau masak apa
buat diriku sendiri di rumah.

1726
02:04:11,182 --> 02:04:13,315
Aku nggak tahu baju apa
yang mau kupakai,

1727
02:04:14,055 --> 02:04:16,231
atau apa yang mau
kutonton di TV.

1728
02:04:17,841 --> 02:04:20,148
Aku sama sekali nggak tahu
siapa aku sebenarnya.

1729
02:04:21,062 --> 02:04:23,891
Setiap aspek hidupku selama ini
dikontrol oleh pria ini.

1730
02:04:25,327 --> 02:04:27,024
Setiap keputusan.

1731
02:04:27,372 --> 02:04:29,070
Siapa pun yang kuajak bicara.

1732
02:04:30,550 --> 02:04:32,639
Aku nggak tahu siapa
yang bisa dipercaya lagi.

1733
02:04:33,683 --> 02:04:35,555
Bahkan keluargaku sendiri.

1734
02:04:39,341 --> 02:04:41,778
Penyesalanku dalam hidup
nggak banyak.

1735
02:04:42,736 --> 02:04:45,608
Tapi aku menyesal tidak menerima
bantuan saat ada yang menawarkan.

1736
02:04:46,391 --> 02:04:47,696
Dan aku berharap aku pergi saja

1737
02:04:47,697 --> 02:04:49,743
saat pertama kali kamu
bersumpah mau membunuhku.

1738
02:04:50,483 --> 02:04:52,572
Mungkin aku pikir
kamu bercanda.

1739
02:04:52,920 --> 02:04:55,270
Tapi sekarang aku tahu,
apa pun niatmu itu,

1740
02:04:55,923 --> 02:04:58,012
orang baik nggak bakal
ngomong sampah kayak gitu.

1741
02:04:59,579 --> 02:05:01,232
Tapi kamu mengatakannya.

1742
02:05:02,320 --> 02:05:05,585
Kamu mengatakannya lagi dan lagi.

1743
02:05:06,890 --> 02:05:09,284
Lalu kamu benar-benar
menepati janji itu.

1744
02:05:10,372 --> 02:05:11,894
Tapi tahu nggak, bajingan?

1745
02:05:11,895 --> 02:05:13,592
Kamu gagal membunuhku.

1746
02:05:13,593 --> 02:05:15,376
Yang Mulia, saya ajukan
keberatan saat ini.

1747
02:05:15,377 --> 02:05:17,074
Ini terlalu konfrontatif.

1748
02:05:17,379 --> 02:05:18,640
Kamu bercanda ya?

1749
02:05:18,641 --> 02:05:20,207
- Aku konfrontatif?
- [hakim] Keberatan diterima.

1750
02:05:20,208 --> 02:05:23,298
Nona Salters, tolong baca saja
pernyataan Anda.

1751
02:05:29,522 --> 02:05:31,306
Kamu menusukku.

1752
02:05:32,525 --> 02:05:33,917
[Christy] Lihat aku!

1753
02:05:34,657 --> 02:05:36,006
Lihat aku, Jim.

1754
02:05:41,359 --> 02:05:42,883
Kamu menusukku.

1755
02:05:43,971 --> 02:05:45,407
Kamu menembakku.

1756
02:05:46,974 --> 02:05:49,237
Kamu meninggalkanku sekarat
di lantai kamar tidur.

1757
02:05:50,804 --> 02:05:54,372
Tapi seperti hal lainnya -
kamu itu nggak becus.

1758
02:05:55,504 --> 02:05:58,158
Kamu nggak becus, kan,
dasar sampah keparat.

1759
02:05:58,159 --> 02:06:00,509
- [pengacara] Keberatan.
- [hakim] Nona Salters.

1760
02:06:02,380 --> 02:06:03,686
Sudahlah.

1761
02:06:04,948 --> 02:06:06,254
Aku sudah selesai.

1762
02:06:09,083 --> 02:06:10,519
Sudah selesai.

1763
02:06:11,651 --> 02:06:14,957
[musik lembut membangkitkan semangat]

1764
02:06:14,958 --> 02:06:18,919
[penonton bersorak di kejauhan]

1765
02:06:30,278 --> 02:06:32,672
[penonton bersorak]

1766
02:06:33,281 --> 02:06:35,196
Jatuhkan dia, juara.

1767
02:06:43,030 --> 02:06:45,554
[penonton bersorak riuh]

1768
02:07:03,528 --> 02:07:06,619
[penonton bersorak dan bertepuk tangan]

1769
02:07:18,195 --> 02:07:23,244
[Lagu "Oath [Triptych]"
oleh MONO mengalun]

1770
02:08:29,745 --> 02:08:33,793
[Lagu berlanjut]

1771
02:10:12,152 --> 02:10:15,329
[musik lembut]